{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Flower of Late Summer That Blooming You Brought Me. This is a medium-length visual novel game. The protagonist, Shionagi, is a boy who has nearly lost his reason for living. His journey begins when his classmate, Ayana, appears and kidnaps him. Summer air, night breezes, and time spent with her, who carries a sense of transience. A bittersweet summer kidnapping drama. You will surely never forget this summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player visual novel. Players read the story and advance the text at their own pace. Occasional choices appear, which may affect the flow of the story. The game focuses on narrative, atmosphere, and character relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031240?t=1770389148","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031240?t=1770389148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031240/2b9370d50f8f26a088421cbf52002b1823a4d194/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770389148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031240/2b9370d50f8f26a088421cbf52002b1823a4d194/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770389148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Flower of Late Summer That Blooming You Brought Me. This is a medium-length visual novel game. The protagonist, Shionagi, is a boy who has nearly lost his reason for living. His journey begins when his classmate, Ayana, appears and kidnaps him. Summer air, night breezes, and time spent with her, who carries a sense of transience. A bittersweet summer kidnapping drama. You will surely never forget this summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p